title: "Organizational Schema Theory — Demo Organization"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Zharnikov"
    given-names: "Dmitry"
    orcid: "0009-0000-6893-9231"
date-released: "2026-05-29"
license: "MIT"
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/spectralbranding/orgschema-demo"
abstract: >
  Working example of Organizational Schema Theory tier-by-tier specification
  for a fictional company (Spectra Coffee). Demonstrates that an entire
  business — products, brand identity, compliance, pricing, nutrition,
  allergens, signals — can be described as machine-readable, version-controlled
  YAML with no ambiguity and no prose-only documentation.
keywords:
  - "organizational schema theory"
  - "spectral brand theory"
  - "infrastructure as code"
  - "business specification"
  - "machine-readable organization"
